<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong July merchandise trade figures.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong July merchandise trade figures.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Census and Statistics Department figures for merchandise trade (rounded figures in billions of H.K. dollars and year-on-year percentage change)</p>
<p>					 July 1996	   June 1996</p>
<p>Re-exports to the five main destinations</p>
<p> China				 37.57 (+13.5)    31.71 (- 4.1)</p>
<p> U.S.				  25.49 (+11.6)    20.17 (- 1.7)</p>
<p> Japan				  6.85 (+16.3)     5.55 (+13.6)</p>
<p> Germany				4.49 (+10.6)     3.65 (- 4.8)</p>
<p> U.K.				   3.66 (+26.6)     2.84 (+ 6.3)</p>
<p>Domestic exports to the five main destinations</p>
<p> China				  5.60 (- 1.9)    4.72 (-17.1)</p>
<p> U.S.				   5.58 (- 9.0)    4.44 (-17.5)</p>
<p> Japan				  1.01 (- 5.2)    0.93 (+ 2.6)</p>
<p> Germany				1.36 (- 2.3)    0.97 (-22.0)</p>
<p> Singapore			    0.84 (-20.9)    0.90 (-13.4)</p>
<p>Imports from the five main suppliers</p>
<p> China				 54.04 (+ 9.4)    45.38 (- 2.3)</p>
<p> Japan				 18.94 (- 3.5)    16.22 (-17.6)</p>
<p> Taiwan				11.00 (- 1.8)     9.58 (-11.8)</p>
<p> U.S.				   9.70 (-11.0)    10.57 (+ 9.1)</p>
<p> Singapore			    7.41 (+20.8)     6.76 (+ 4.1)</p>
</text>
